    "在微信「我-服务-钱包-账单」或支付宝「我的-账单」申请导出 CSV 账单后，从文件 App 导入。数据只保存在你的设备和 iCloud。" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Export your bill as CSV from WeChat Pay or Alipay, then import it from the Files app. Your data stays on your device and iCloud only." } } } },
